```mdl
verdict F-6.1: A timed Dream fades its master gain linearly to zero over its last 30 s, or its whole length when shorter, then stops.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-zen/src/generator/sleep-fade.ts#timedPlaybackStep, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-zen/src/generator/sleep-fade.ts#sleepFadeSeconds, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-zen/src/components/Mixer/Mixer.tsx#Mixer, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-zen/src/generator/mixer.ts#MixerEngine.fadeOut]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-zen/src/generator/sleep-fade.test.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-zen/src/generator/mixer.test.ts]
  walkthrough:
    - sleepFadeSeconds caps the fade at SLEEP_FADE_SECONDS (30) or the Dream's duration. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-zen/src/generator/sleep-fade.ts#sleepFadeSeconds
    - timedPlaybackStep asks for the fade once remaining falls to that length, and for a stop at zero. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-zen/src/generator/sleep-fade.ts#timedPlaybackStep
    - Mixer runs the step on every countdown tick and acts on it. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-zen/src/components/Mixer/Mixer.tsx#Mixer
    - fadeOut ramps the master gain linearly to zero over the remaining seconds. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-zen/src/generator/mixer.ts#MixerEngine.fadeOut
```

